\f0\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 When I started managing my first team, aged 24, I had a shock. I\'92d had big business training and they hadn\'92t. The gulf, it turned out was huge.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\

\f0\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 I had a steep learning curve to get used to life in a start-up, but my foundational understanding of how to build a brand & review marketing work was essential to every decision I was making.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\

\f0\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 When I went to find training for the team so that they could get these basics in place, everything was prohibitively expensive. Old school marketing training institutes had courses with shiny certificates for \'a33k + VAT, and that was more than my whole team\'92s budget. None of the courses were taught by people who had experience taking big business training and applying it to start-ups.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\

\f0\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Brand Manager Boot Camp was born\'85!
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\

\f0\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 I created our Brand Manager Boot Camp course to help train junior marketers and provide them with the skills, practical tools and immediate actions needed to really make a difference for start-up brands.
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\

\f0\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Choosing an entrepreneurial business environment shouldn\'92t mean you miss out on the training and development opportunities you\'92d have at bigger companies. Brand Management is a skill set and we want to make sure that brilliant young talent at start ups have the opportunity to learn.
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\

\f0\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Investing in learning the basics has clear, outsized returns for you. Decisions get made faster and strategic thinking is meaningfully improved.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\

\f0\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 We\'92re kicking off this week for the 6th time. The feedback has been incredible every-time & we\'92ve trained over 120 people.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\

